{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big判Y：Y的大块本身就是连贯的情节信息，能直接看出人物此刻的处境和变化；X只看加亮词时，容易得到一串零散的情绪和判断。small判X：X的补充更具体，例如“像熟人安静坐着，偶尔对视也不尴尬”“白天和某个人相处得很好，独处时心头却泛酸”，既有辨识度，也能挂回人物关系；Y部分小字较概括。core判X：X更完整地保留了从害怕给对方添负担、得到亲近后的安心，到越喜欢越害怕失去的因果变化，幸福与留不住它的痛楚交织得更充分。concise判Y：Y删去了不少重复铺陈，同一情绪不必反复解释。human判X：Y有“连相处也变”“越怕时间快”“时间短暂松出空地”等搭配或省略不够自然的地方，X整体更符合日常表达习惯。fine判X：X保留了“话到喉咙口忽然发紧”“熟悉的温柔还在，可知道它有多珍贵后，心里反而更容易发疼”等具体体验，Y则有些地方压缩成了“幸福掺苦涩”“渴望翻涌”一类概括。load判Y：Y的短块分时出现，更容易边听边扫；X长段同时呈现，阅读压力明显更大。综合来看，X在small、core、human、fine四项上的优势略胜于Y在big、concise、load三项上的优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "053bed7b-f844-429a-8c75-612dd409134c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T141929260101Z", "elapsed_seconds": 183.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T14:22:32.645364+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c98e0b512c5ff77f66eccdaed0be9eae047e908ff804fa047374f86b816027e9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable